```
MCP Task Routing Header/Body Value Disagreement (Track 1)

Placeholder source: index=mcp_security_audit sourcetype=mcp:audit:json -- this index/sourcetype
is NOT shipped by Splunk by default; a deployment must create it and ingest the Block 2
telemetry contract events into it. See detections/field-mapping.md.

Sigma equivalent: detections/sigma/mcp_task_routing_desynchronization.yml

PRIMARY, high-confidence search: value disagreement only. Deliberately does not fire on
"missing" or "version_incompatible" results -- a missing header under a protocol version that
never required it (pre-2026-07-28, pre-SEP-2243) is compatibility traffic, not a routing
violation. See the separate, lower-confidence diagnostic search below.
```

index=mcp_security_audit sourcetype=mcp:audit:json source="task_get_identity_mismatch.jsonl" "event.name"="mcp.request.validation"
    ("mcp.validation.method.result"="conflict" OR "mcp.validation.name.result"="conflict")
| eval Severity="High"
| eval DetectionTrack="Track1_TaskRoutingDesynchronization"
| eval ConflictOnMethod=if('mcp.validation.method.result'="conflict", "true", "false")
| eval ConflictOnIdentity=if('mcp.validation.name.result'="conflict", "true", "false")
| table _time Severity DetectionTrack "jsonrpc.request.id" "mcp.protocol.version"
    "mcp.header.method" "mcp.body.method" "mcp.header.name_hash" "mcp.body.identity_hash"
    ConflictOnMethod ConflictOnIdentity "mcp.validation.method.result" "mcp.validation.name.result"
    "mcp.validation.source" "mcp.validation.reason"
| sort 0 _time

```
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
OPTIONAL DIAGNOSTIC SEARCH -- lower confidence, kept as an entirely SEPARATE saved search from
the primary one above. Fires on missing/malformed routing validation results. Do not union
this into the primary search's results; it is intentionally a different, lower-severity
finding (see detections/README.md).
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

index=mcp_security_audit sourcetype=mcp:audit:json "event.name"="mcp.request.validation"
    (("mcp.validation.method.result"="missing" OR "mcp.validation.method.result"="malformed")
     OR ("mcp.validation.name.result"="missing" OR "mcp.validation.name.result"="malformed"))
| eval Severity="Low"
| eval DetectionTrack="Track1_RoutingHeaderDiagnostic"
| table _time Severity DetectionTrack "jsonrpc.request.id" "mcp.protocol.version"
    "mcp.validation.method.result" "mcp.validation.name.result" "mcp.validation.source"
    "mcp.validation.reason"
| sort 0 _time
```
